@startuml
title Teaching Plan and Delivery Monitoring
actor Lecturer
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant API
participant "Authorisation" as Auth
participant "Teaching Plan Service" as Service
database PostgreSQL
Lecturer -> UI: Create plan for assigned offering
UI -> API: POST /teaching-plans
API -> Auth: Check teaching_plans.manage + scope
Auth --> API: Allowed
API -> Service: Create plan and immutable version 1
Service -> PostgreSQL: Insert plan + version + audit
PostgreSQL --> Service: IDs
Service --> UI: Plan summary
Lecturer -> UI: Record session delivered
UI -> API: POST /teaching-sessions/{id}/status
API -> Service: Fail-closed state transition
Service -> PostgreSQL: Preserve planned and actual evidence
@enduml
